#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:42
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:43
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&keepsecret; is a KDE password manager that stores and manages secrets "
"securely using the freedesktop Secret Service API. It allows you to store "
"passwords, keys, and other sensitive information in encrypted wallets."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:49
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&keepsecret; works alongside other applications that use the Secret Service "
"API, such as web browsers and development tools, providing a unified place "
"to manage all your stored credentials."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:57
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using KeepSecret"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:60
#, no-c-format
msgid "Wallets"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:61
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A wallet is a collection of secrets. &keepsecret; displays your wallets in "
"the left sidebar. Click a wallet to view its contents."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:65
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To create a new wallet, open the menu and select <guimenuitem>New Wallet</"
"guimenuitem>. To delete a wallet, open the wallet action menu and select "
"<guimenuitem>Delete Wallet</guimenuitem>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:74
#, no-c-format
msgid "Managing Entries"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:75
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Each wallet contains a list of secret entries. Click an entry to view its "
"details in the right panel."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:79
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To create a new entry, click the <guibutton>New Entry</guibutton> button in "
"the toolbar. Fill in the label, password, user, and server fields. You can "
"click <guibutton>Generate</guibutton> to automatically generate a strong "
"random password."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:85
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To copy a password to the clipboard, click the <guibutton>Copy Password</"
"guibutton> button. The password will be automatically cleared from the "
"clipboard after 30 seconds."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:93
#, no-c-format
msgid "Import and Export"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:94
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&keepsecret; can export your wallet to a <filename>.keepsecret</filename> "
"file for backup or transfer. To export, open the wallet action menu and "
"select <guimenuitem>Export…</guimenuitem>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:100
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To import secrets, select <guimenuitem>Import…</guimenuitem> from the wallet "
"action menu. You can import both <filename>.keepsecret</filename> files and "
"legacy KWallet XML files."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:108
#, no-c-format
msgid "Locking and Unlocking"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:109
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can lock a wallet to protect its contents. Click the <guibutton>Lock</"
"guibutton> button in the toolbar to lock the current wallet. To unlock it, "
"click <guibutton>Unlock</guibutton>."
msgstr ""

